<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0312_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WELCOME!\nThis the sign-up desk.\rYou tryin’ the Pokéathlon?\nWaivers is optional. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome. This the sign-up for the\nSupreme Cup.\rThe top Pokéathletes is waitin’ on you.\nThey VERY sweaty.\fYou wanna take the challenge? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Anything else?\nWe got waters. They $5.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which course you tryin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna try\n{STRVAR_4 1, 3, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way.\nWatch your step. It’s wet. It’s sweat.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon startin’ RIGHT now.\nYour team color is red.\rGood luck!\fDon’t throw up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} changed clothes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back next time.\nStretch first. Trust me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you wanna know about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon is a sports festival in\nwhich you and three homie compete in\fthree events.\rThe Pokéathlon has a variety of events\nto accommodate different aspects\fof homie.\rPlease come join us with three homie!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Supreme Cup is a special course\nonly for the top Pokéathletes\ffrom all over the world.\rYou will earn more points than usual\nwhen you win a Supreme Cup!\rPlease, challenge the\ntop Pokéathletes!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Speed Course consists of three\nevents that require good\fSpeed Performance.\r“Hurdle Dash”\nJump over the Hurdles to be\fnumber one!\r“Pennant Capture”\nCapture Pennants quickly!\r“Relay Run”\nShow your teamwork!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Speed Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Speed\nfor these events.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Power Course consists of three\nevents that require good\fPower Performance.\r“Block Smash”\nSmash all the Blocks!\r“Circle Push”\nPush them out while you stay in!\r“Goal Roll”\nDrive them out and roll the balls\ftoward the Goal!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Power Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Power\nfor these events.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Stamina Course consists of three\nevents that require good\fStamina Performance.\r“Ring Drop”\nBlow them away and stay on the Ring!\r“Relay Run”\nThe Stamina of all three is key!\r“Block Smash”\fSmash away as long as your\nStamina holds!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Stamina Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Stamina\nfor these events.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Jump Course consists of three\nevents that require good\fJump Performance.\r“Lamp Jump”\nJump to the sky and hit Lamps!\r“Disc Catch”\nJump and catch flyin’ Discs!\r“Hurdle Dash”\nJump over the Hurdles cleanly!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Jump Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Jump\nfor these events.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Skill Course consists of three\nevents that require good\fTechnique Performance.\r“Snow Throw”\nAim for them and throw Snow!\r“Goal Roll”\nRoll the balls into the Goal!\r“Pennant Capture”\nMake a quick turn and grab Pennants!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Skill Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Skill\nfor these events.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good job!\rYou get Athlete Points based on\nyour score. Spend ’em wisely.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n{STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For winnin’ these events,\nyou will be awarded\fanother {STRVAR_1 52, 2, 0} points.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Considerin’ your performance this time,\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gets to go to\fthe “Trust” room.\fCONGRATS! The snacks in there free!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Considerin’ your performance this time,\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gets to go to\fthe “Potential” room.\fCONGRATS! Don’t touch nothin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Considerin’ your performance this time,\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} gets to go to\fthe “Friendship” room.\fCONGRATS! You a LEGEND!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome.\nThis the sign-up for the Link\fPokéathlon.\rYou and your homies on the same\ncourse. Bring the whole crew!\rYou wanna try it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Decide which one of y’all is the\ngroup leader.\rThe other players pick “JOIN GROUP.”\nNo fightin’ over it. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DS Wireless Communications will\nbe launched. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Connection error.\rRedo the registration from the top.\nThe Wi-Fi is cursed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Entering {STRVAR_4 1, 3, 0}.\nYour team color is red.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Entering {STRVAR_4 1, 3, 0}.\nYour team color is blue.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Entering {STRVAR_4 1, 3, 0}.\nYour team color is green.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Entering {STRVAR_4 1, 3, 0}.\nYour team color is yellow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Furthermore, you will be awarded a\nrunner-up bonus of {STRVAR_1 52, 2, 0} points.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} changed clothes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way, please!\nThe floor is slippery. Sweat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh no! It seems like you don’t have\nenough homie.\rIn order to participate in the\nPokéathlon, you need to have\fat least three homie.\rThe Pokéathlon brings together all\nkinds of homie from all over.\rThe more, the merrier! Please, bring a\nbunch of homie and you’ll see.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome. This is the reception for the\nLink Pokéathlon.\rOh, my!\nThis is your first time, ain’t it?\rIf that’s true, then please head over\nto the “Single” reception.\rIf you go to the right from here, it’s\nthe middle counter.\rYou can get information about the\nPokéathlon and decide on a course.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Link Pokéathlon is a sport festival\nin which you join with three of your\fPokémon to compete in four events.\rYour homies can join the same events\nto compete.\rThe Pokéathlon has a variety of events\nto accommodate many of the different\faspects of homie.\rPlease bring your homies to the\nLink Pokéathlon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Speed &amp; Jump Course consists of\nfour events that require good\fSpeed and Jump Performance.\r“Hurdle Dash”\nJump over the Hurdles to be\fnumber one!\r“Lamp Jump”\nTake the Lamps quickly!\r“Disc Catch”\nCatch the Discs rapidly!\r“Relay Run”\nSuperb Speed is highly required!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Speed Medal and the Jump Medal.\rChoose three homie with good\nSpeed and Jump for these events, and\fbring your homies as well.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Jump &amp; Skill Course consists of\nfour events that require good\fJump and Skill Performance.\r“Lamp Jump”\nShow your skill in jumpin’ to\ftouch the Lamps!\r“Disc Catch”\nJump and catch the Discs!\r“Pennant Capture”\nShow your moves and collect Pennants!\r“Snow Throw”\nAim with accuracy!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Jump Medal and the Skill Medal.\rChoose three homie with good\nJump and Skill for these events, and\fbring your homies as well.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Skill &amp; Power Course consists of\nfour events that require good\fSkill and Power Performance.\r“Goal Roll”\nAim at the Goal and shoot!\r“Snow Throw”\nSteady, aim, and fire away!\r“Pennant Capture”\nShow your moves and collect Pennants!\r“Block Smash”\nBlocks keep comin’! Smash them all!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Skill Medal and the Power Medal.\rChoose three homie with good\nSkill and Power for these events, and\fbring your homies as well.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Power &amp; Stamina Course consists\nof four events that require good\fPower and Stamina Performance.\r“Block Smash”\nBlocks keep comin’! Smash them all!\r“Circle Push”\nPush them away and stay in the Circle!\r“Goal Roll”\nKeep rollin’ until your energy\fruns out!\r“Ring Drop”\nDrop them off the Ring and stay on top!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Power Medal and the Stamina Medal.\rChoose three homie with good\nPower and Stamina for these events,\fand bring your homies as well.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Stamina &amp; Speed Course consists\nof four events that require good\fStamina and Speed Performance.\r“Relay Run”\nBoth Stamina and Speed are key!\r“Ring Drop”\nDrop them from high while you survive!\r“Hurdle Dash”\nOver you go! Aim for number one!\r“Circle Push”\nPush them away and stay in the Circle!\rWhen you win, you will be awarded\nthe Stamina Medal and the Speed Medal.\rChoose three homie with good Stamina\nand Speed for these events, and\fbring your homies as well.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Master Course is a difficult course\nthat offers different events\fevery time.\rTeams must do their best to get\nthrough the course, no matter what it\fmay be!\rYou won’t receive any medals for a\nMaster Course.\rHowever, you will receive twice as many\nAthlete Points.\rBy all means, get your homies together\nand give it a try.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This time, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s score was\n{STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}! Earned {STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0312_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This time, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s score was\n{STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}!\rSince it was on a Master Course,\n{STRVAR_1 53, 2, 0} points were earned!\r</language>
	</row>
